# Focused KB-first round fourteen: act-loop branch operations are a live
# ternary relation, including a surface that did not exist at compile time.
[mock hermetic]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_WORLD_FACTS=0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!set PARROT0_TOOLS=1
!reset

[test existing and taught branch operations]
!query agent_branch_step("double", "*", 2)
!query agent_branch_step("dimezza", "/", 2)
!assert agent_branch_step("doublefast", "*", 2)
!query agent_branch_step("doublefast", "*", 2)
> start at 2. if it is even, doublefast. if it is odd, halve. repeat until it reaches 4.
< Reached 4 after 1 step: 2 -> 4.
!forget agent_branch_step("doublefast", "*", 2)
!query! agent_branch_step("doublefast", "*", 2)

[new KB-backed vocabulary remains teachable]
!query module_capability(knowledge, "answer questions about facts and logical rules")
!query social_act_type(goodnight)
!assert module_capability(calculus, "derive symbolic answers")
!query module_capability(calculus, "derive symbolic answers")
!forget module_capability(calculus, "derive symbolic answers")
!query! module_capability(calculus, "derive symbolic answers")

[test Italian branch operation remains live]
> parti da 6. se è pari, dimezza. se è dispari, triplica e aggiungi 1. ripeti finché raggiunge 1.
< Reached 1 after 8 steps: 6 -> 3 -> 10 -> 5 -> 16 -> 8 -> 4 -> 2 -> 1.
